    {
      "block_id": "2605.24856_p14_b2",
      "text": "A CAZ Profile is characterized by: - n_regions: Number of distinct allocation regions (1 =\nunimodal, 2+ = multimodal) - peak region: The region with the highest peak separation -\nPer-region: start, peak, end, width, peak separation, coherence, rise/fall asymmetry\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.6,
        557.35,
